A||||5||thecage||electrical problems||||1||
Z||000000||thecage||11-16-2001||09:36 PM||||Well I hope someone can give me a few pointers on some electrical problems I have. All other electrical items in the car work. The radio seems to loose it's power everytime I shut the car off. It looses it's memory for the clock and programmed stations. The stations also seem weak in reception. The other problem i'm having is the cigarte lighter does not work, but when I push the lighter in to get it hot the bottom interior light's come on, just like my lighter was a switch. Any ideas for solving this problem.||||reg||1
Z||000001||RossT||11-16-2001||09:51 PM||||Its your lucky day!!  Your 20amp BAT fuse<BR>has blown.  <P>The formula I just bought had the same problems.  Open the car door and your radio goes dead, push the horn and the lights under the day go off, cigar lighter not working etc etc.  I spent an hour looking thru electrical diagrams and concluded that all the above items were on the same fuse.  Looked at the fuse and sure enough it was blown..  You should have some spare fuses next to the fuse block..  At least gm did something good and gave you some spares!!<P>Well grab a flashlight and go out and check!!<p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 11-16-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||thecage||11-16-2001||10:08 PM||||RossT, i grabbed a flashlight and checked the bat fuse and it was ok, not just kidding you nailed it right on the head i guess it is my lucky day i should go play the lottery. Thanks for your suggestion.||||reg||1
Z||000003||RossT||11-16-2001||10:21 PM||||you had me there for a second!!||||reg||1
Z||000004||theogre||11-17-2001||08:59 PM||||While you're at it... check these if it blows again. <P>make sure there isn't a bunch of trash down in the lighter socket....<P>Also, the lighter elements do go bad...<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000005||RossT||11-17-2001||09:50 PM||||Ogre is dead on!  My daughter once put a penny in the cigar lighter receptical.  Blew fuse after fuse....until I looked down in it!||||reg||1
